+---
+'@radix-ui/react-slot': patch
+---
+
+Fixed infinite update loop (Maximum update depth exceeded) in React 19 when a `Slot` with a forwarded ref re-renders, by memoizing the composed ref so it is only re-attached when its underlying refs change
